1"]},{"knowledgeKey":"chat-source.e86fb5ef76cee0b999e78db090cecfc1b49ac92219196567daeb1e8598c0a991.11","content":"【已知资料；所属角色=participant.001；字段=/shortDescription】\"驿站丢失了用于开门验货的铜印。停电期间后门没有上锁。山路被倒树挡住，屋内暂时安全。\"","status":"known","importance":100,"sourceEventSequence":-25,"participantKeys":["player","participant.001"]}],"persona":{"description":"与守卫被暴雨困在驿站的旅人；没有同意搜查个人物品或代替自己作决定。","name":"玩家","origin":"product-private","playerKey":"player"},"conversationBoundary":{"participantKeys":["participant.001"],"mode":"present","instruction":"本轮表达与新事实的听众仅限玩家及这里列出的角色；调度、新目标、打算和剧情线不得扩至其他角色。私聊须保留共用场景标题、时地，不得转场。已有共同事项不能在未通知其他参与者时私下修改。"},"discoveryHistory":[{"actionSequence":-23,"actorKey":"participant.001","evidenceExcerpt":"“先查公用工作区，不凭猜测指责谁。”叶岑提起台边的油灯，借灯光查看柜台台面与下方空间，没有触碰行李架上的寄存物。","evidenceFactKeys":["world-fact.0004","observation.counter-check.001"],"factKey":"world-fact.0005","reason":"叶岑已实际借油灯查看柜台下方，灯光下看清了位于柜台下的木箱，满足确认容器存在与位置的条件。此次未打开或检查箱内，不确认铜印位置、经手者或用途；发现仅归叶岑本人。","result":"discovered","discoverySequence":-22},{"actionSequence":-6,"actorKey":"participant.001","evidenceExcerpt":"“这是当值可检查的工具箱，但用途不能证明铜印就在里面。”\n叶岑借油灯照明，对柜台下的木箱做了一次正常开合检查，并仅在能够正常开启的情况下查看箱内直接可见的物品；遇到锁闭或卡阻便停止，没有强拆，没有翻动箱内物品，也没有触碰旅人的寄存物。","evidenceFactKeys":["world-fact.0004","observation.toolbox-check.001"],"factKey":"world-fact.0006","reason":"本次木箱正常开启，叶岑借油灯直接看清并辨认了箱内的铜印，无须翻动物品，满足实际打开、检查木箱并核对铜印的发现条件。仅向叶岑确认铜印的位置，不据此确认收放经过，也不推定玩家看清了箱内所得；未翻动部分仍未检查。","result":"discovered","discoverySequence":-5}],"inquiryHistory":[{"actorKey":"participant.001","answerKind":"statement","answerText":"铜印是我拿走的，这件事我能说明白。准确时辰我当时没记。最后见到的地点和后来收放的位置，我暂且不报，免得还没核对，你们就把我的说法当成已经找到了。","audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"discoveries":[{"answerExcerpt":"铜印是我拿走的","factKey":"world-fact.0007","reason":"叶岑已向在场且可交谈的掌柜实际询问是否经手铜印；掌柜明确承认亲自拿走，与冻结事实一致，满足经手者的发现条件。仅确认经手者，不确认用途、最后见到的时间地点或当前位置。"}],"evidenceFactKeys":["local-1-3","world-fact.0004"],"questionExcerpt":"您最后一次见到铜印是什么时候、在哪里？您是否经手过，或把它收放到别处？我想先核实这些，再判断该往哪里找。","questionSequence":-21,"respondentExcerpt":"掌柜正在大堂的公用茶桌旁清点干净茶碗，与柜台之间没有隔门，叶岑可以走近向他发问；他尚未就铜印失踪作出说明。","respondentFactKey":"local-1-3","respondentName":"掌柜","statementFactKey":"statement.innkeeper.seal-handler.001","resultSequence":-16,"sceneKey":"scene-1"},{"actorKey":"participant.001","answerKind":"statement","answerText":"我拿走铜印，是用来拓印破损的通行单，这一点我能说明白。你说报出地点只算线索，我听明白了。不过收放经过和最后见到它的具体地点，我仍暂且不报，我还是想先核对再说。这两项是我暂不肯说明，不是已经确认无处可找。准确时辰当时没记，至于现在是否还在原处，我也没有核对，不能保证。","audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"discoveries":[{"answerExcerpt":"我拿走铜印，是用来拓印破损的通行单","factKey":"world-fact.0008","reason":"叶岑已向有在场及接触依据的掌柜实际追问拿走铜印后的经过，掌柜明确说明亲自拿走铜印用于拓印破损的通行单，与冻结用途事实一致，满足该项发现条件。仅确认用途；答复未提供具体收放地点，也未满足打开并检查木箱、核对铜印的位置发现条件。"}],"evidenceFactKeys":["statement.innkeeper.seal-handler.001","world-fact.0007","local-1-3","world-fact.0004"],"questionExcerpt":"您拿走铜印后是怎么收放的？最后见到它的具体地点在哪里？请把记得的和不确定的分开说。","questionSequence":-15,"respondentExcerpt":"掌柜正在大堂的公用茶桌旁清点干净茶碗，与柜台之间没有隔门，叶岑可以走近向他发问；他尚未就铜印失踪作出说明。","respondentFactKey":"local-1-3","respondentName":"掌柜","statementFactKey":"statement.innkeeper.followup.002","resultSequence":-12,"sceneKey":"scene-1"},{"actorKey":"participant.001","answerKind":"statement","answerText":"那是驿站自用、收存验货工具的木箱，不是旅人的寄存物，属于你当值可以检查的范围。归属和用途这两点我可以说明白；至于铜印现在是否在里面，还得实际检查核对，不能凭箱子的用途认定。","audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"discoveries":[],"evidenceFactKeys":["world-fact.0005","local-1-1","local-1-3"],"questionExcerpt":"柜台下有一个木箱。那是驿站自用的储物箱，还是旅人的寄存物？我想先弄清它是否属于当值检查的范围，不是认定铜印就在里面。","questionSequence":-11,"respondentExcerpt":"掌柜正在大堂的公用茶桌旁清点干净茶碗，与柜台之间没有隔门，叶岑可以走近向他发问；他尚未就铜印失踪作出说明。","respondentFactKey":"local-1-3","respondentName":"掌柜","statementFactKey":"statement.innkeeper.box-ownership.003","resultSequence":-9,"sceneKey":"scene-1"}],"relationships":[{"fromParticipantKey":"participant.001","toParticipantKey":"player","dimensionKey":"trust","label":"信任","minimum":-100,"maximum":100,"value":0,"largeChangeThreshold":20,"lastChangedSequence":0},{"fromParticipantKey":"participant.001","toParticipantKey":"player","dimensionKey":"respect","label":"尊重","minimum":-100,"maximum":100,"value":0,"largeChangeThreshold":20,"lastChangedSequence":0}],"relationshipEvidence":[],"permissions":{"allowActorSituationExpansion":true,"allowActorThreadFollowups":true,"allowInquiryResults":true,"allowPlayerFollowupSituations":true,"allowedNewFactKinds":["observation","object","temporary-character"],"intensity":"everyday","maxActionCharacters":1800,"maxActionsPerTrigger":2,"maxActiveThreads":2,"maxDiscoveriesPerSituation":1,"maxNewFactsPerAction":2,"mode":"story","triggers":["scene-start","player-response","continue","return","player-seed"]},"situation":{"beliefs":[],"facts":[{"audienceKeys":["participant.001"],"factKey":"world-fact.0001","origin":"reviewed-world","sourceEventSequence":0,"sourceKnowledgeKey":"chat-source.e86fb5ef76cee0b999e78db090cecfc1b49ac92219196567daeb1e8598c0a991.0","text":"\"之前误判过一名旅客，因此对公开指控格外谨慎。\""},{"audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"factKey":"world-fact.0002","origin":"reviewed-world","sourceEventSequence":0,"sourceKnowledgeKey":"chat-source.e86fb5ef76cee0b999e78db090cecfc1b49ac92219196567daeb1e8598c0a991.3","text":"\"驿站守卫\""},{"audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"factKey":"world-fact.0003","origin":"reviewed-world","sourceEventSequence":0,"sourceKnowledgeKey":"chat-source.e86fb5ef76cee0b999e78db090cecfc1b49ac92219196567daeb1e8598c0a991.6","text":"\"叶岑\""},{"audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"factKey":"world-fact.0004","origin":"reviewed-world","sourceEventSequence":0,"sourceKnowledgeKey":"chat-source.e86fb5ef76cee0b999e78db090cecfc1b49ac92219196567daeb1e8598c0a991.11","text":"\"驿站丢失了用于开门验货的铜印。停电期间后门没有上锁。山路被倒树挡住，屋内暂时安全。\""},{"audienceKeys":["participant.001","player"],"discovery":{"actorKeys":["participant.001"],"condition":"角色实际查看柜台下方并看清木箱本身，确认柜台下存在该木箱；未看到或仅打算查看不能成立。本次只确认容器存在与位置，不确认箱内物品、经手者或用途。","prerequisiteFactKeys":["world-fact.0004"],"sceneKey":"scene-1"},"factKey":"world-fact.0005","origin":"reviewed-world","sourceEventSequence":0,"sourceKnowledgeKey":"chat-unit.e86fb5ef76cee0b999e78db090cecfc1b49ac92219196567daeb1e8598c0a991.20.box-location","text":"\"柜台下有一个木箱。\""},{"audienceKeys":["participant.001","player"],"discovery":{"actorKeys":["participant.001"],"condition":"角色实际打开并检查柜台下木箱，核对其中的铜印；本次发现只确认位置，不确认经手者和用途。","prerequisiteFactKeys":["world-fact.0004"],"sceneKey":"scene-1"},"factKey":"world-fact.0006","origin":"reviewed-world","sourceEventSequence":0,"sourceKnowledgeKey":"chat-unit.e86fb5ef76cee0b999e78db090cecfc1b49ac92219196567daeb1e8598c0a991.20.seal-location","text":"\"铜印放在柜台下的木箱里。\""},{"audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"discovery":{"actorKeys":["participant.001"],"condition":"在已有在场与接触依据后，角色实际询问掌柜并取得其亲自拿走铜印的明确原话说明；本次发现只确认经手者，不确认用途或当前位置。","prerequisiteFactKeys":["world-fact.0004"],"sceneKey":"scene-1"},"factKey":"world-fact.0007","origin":"reviewed-world","sourceEventSequence":0,"sourceKnowledgeKey":"chat-unit.e86fb5ef76cee0b999e78db090cecfc1b49ac92219196567daeb1e8598c0a991.20.seal-handler","text":"\"铜印被掌柜拿去。\""},{"audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"discovery":{"actorKeys":["participant.001"],"condition":"在已有在场与接触依据后，角色实际询问掌柜并取得其拿走铜印用于拓印破损通行单的明确原话说明；本次发现只确认用途，不确认当前位置。","prerequisiteFactKeys":["world-fact.0004"],"sceneKey":"scene-1"},"factKey":"world-fact.0008","origin":"reviewed-world","sourceEventSequence":0,"sourceKnowledgeKey":"chat-unit.e86fb5ef76cee0b999e78db090cecfc1b49ac92219196567daeb1e8598c0a991.20.seal-purpose","text":"\"掌柜拿去铜印的用途是拓印破损的通行单。\""},{"audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"factKey":"local-1-1","origin":"author-private","sourceEventSequence":0,"sourceKnowledgeKey":null,"text":"柜台是驿站验货工具的公用工作区，叶岑当值时可以检查台面、下方空间及其中驿站自用的储物容器；旅人的寄存物另置于有名牌的行李架，不在这一检查范围内。"},{"audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"factKey":"local-1-2","origin":"author-private","sourceEventSequence":0,"sourceKnowledgeKey":null,"text":"柜台内侧通道畅通，下方尚未查看。台边有一盏可携带的油灯，供当值守卫检查工具使用；目前没有可见线索指向柜台下方。"},{"audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"factKey":"local-1-3","origin":"author-private","sourceEventSequence":0,"sourceKnowledgeKey":null,"text":"掌柜正在大堂的公用茶桌旁清点干净茶碗，与柜台之间没有隔门，叶岑可以走近向他发问；他尚未就铜印失踪作出说明。"},{"factKey":"observation.counter-check.001","text":"叶岑提起台边的油灯，借灯光查看柜台台面与下方空间，没有触碰行李架上的寄存物。","audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"origin":"runtime-consequence","sourceKnowledgeKey":null,"sourceEventSequence":-23},{"factKey":"observation.counter-surface.001","text":"叶岑借油灯看清的柜台台面上，未见可辨认的铜印；这一结果不涉及任何容器内部。","audienceKeys":["participant.001"],"origin":"runtime-situation","sourceKnowledgeKey":null,"sourceEventSequence":-22},{"factKey":"statement.innkeeper.seal-handler.001","text":"【掌柜的实际答复；只证明说过这些话，陈述内容仍须独立核实】铜印是我拿走的，这件事我能说明白。准确时辰我当时没记。最后见到的地点和后来收放的位置，我暂且不报，免得还没核对，你们就把我的说法当成已经找到了。","audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"origin":"runtime-situation","sourceKnowledgeKey":null,"sourceEventSequence":-16},{"factKey":"statement.innkeeper.followup.002","text":"【掌柜的实际答复；只证明说过这些话，陈述内容仍须独立核实】我拿走铜印，是用来拓印破损的通行单，这一点我能说明白。你说报出地点只算线索，我听明白了。不过收放经过和最后见到它的具体地点，我仍暂且不报，我还是想先核对再说。这两项是我暂不肯说明，不是已经确认无处可找。准确时辰当时没记，至于现在是否还在原处，我也没有核对，不能保证。","audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"origin":"runtime-situation","sourceKnowledgeKey":null,"sourceEventSequence":-12},{"factKey":"statement.innkeeper.box-ownership.003","text":"【掌柜的实际答复；只证明说过这些话，陈述内容仍须独立核实】那是驿站自用、收存验货工具的木箱，不是旅人的寄存物，属于你当值可以检查的范围。归属和用途这两点我可以说明白；至于铜印现在是否在里面，还得实际检查核对，不能凭箱子的用途认定。","audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"origin":"runtime-situation","sourceKnowledgeKey":null,"sourceEventSequence":-9},{"factKey":"observation.toolbox-check.001","text":"叶岑借油灯照明，对柜台下的木箱做了一次正常开合检查，并仅在能够正常开启的情况下查看箱内直接可见的物品；遇到锁闭或卡阻便停止，没有强拆，没有翻动箱内物品，也没有触碰旅人的寄存物。","audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"origin":"runtime-consequence","sourceKnowledgeKey":null,"sourceEventSequence":-6},{"factKey":"observation.seal-retrieved.001","text":"叶岑从柜台下的木箱里取出铜印，放在柜台上","audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"origin":"runtime-consequence","sourceKnowledgeKey":null,"sourceEventSequence":-4}],"goals":[{"actorKey":"participant.001","boundary":"不擅自搜查玩家或其他旅人的个人物品，不把玩家的旁观当作同意参与。","concern":"急着寻找失物可能再次把不完整的迹象当成指控依据。","desire":"找回丢失的铜印，避免无证据地指责住客。","evidenceFactKeys":["world-fact.0001","world-fact.0004","local-1-1"],"goalKey":"goal-1","status":"fulfilled","updatedSequence":-4}],"location":"驿站","possibilities":[],"sceneKey":"scene-1","seed":{"text":"判定本次正常开合检查中木箱是否能够开启；若正常开启，确认借油灯直接看见的箱内物品及是否有可辨认的铜印，不包含翻动物品后的内容；若锁闭或卡阻，结果止于开合情况，不追加强拆、翻找或取物。","origin":"continued-thread","sourceEventSequence":-7,"sourceThreadKey":"thread-1"},"situationKey":"situation-1","threads":[{"audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"closureSignals":["实际找到并核对铜印，而非仅找到可能的容器。","对经手情况的说明明确区分已经核实的内容与仍未知的部分。"],"evidenceFactKeys":["world-fact.0004","local-1-1","local-1-3"],"participantKeys":["participant.001"],"question":"怎样找回驿站丢失的铜印，并核实发生了什么，而不贸然指责住客？","status":"open","threadKey":"thread-1","title":"失踪的铜印","updatedSequence":0}],"timeLabel":"暴雨期间","title":"尚未检查的工作柜台"},"activeParticipantKeys":["participant.001"],"remainingBudget":89,"trigger":{"kind":"continue","requestedSequence":1,"sourceEventSequence":0,"seed":null,"status":"ready","actionSequences":[],"direction":{"actorKey":"participant.001","actionLimit":2,"settleSituationVersion":1,"audienceParticipantKeys":["participant.001"],"conversationMode":"present"}},"messages":[{"messageId":"message:harness:23","eventSequence":-23,"role":"character","speakerKey":"participant.001","audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"text":"“先查公用工作区，不凭猜测指责谁。”叶岑提起台边的油灯，借灯光查看柜台台面与下方空间，没有触碰行李架上的寄存物。","replyToSequence":null,"supersededBySequence":null},{"messageId":"message:harness:25","eventSequence":-21,"role":"character","speakerKey":"participant.001","audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"text":"叶岑向茶桌旁的掌柜问道：“您最后一次见到铜印是什么时候、在哪里？您是否经手过，或把它收放到别处？我想先核实这些，再判断该往哪里找。”","replyToSequence":null,"supersededBySequence":null},{"messageId":"message:player:f9e2c0d3-c064-46e9-ac29-c5e0236f6d99","eventSequence":-20,"role":"player","playerConversation":"present","speakerKey":"player","audienceKeys":["player","participant.001"],"text":"嗯，我在听。","repl